            <title>[IGNITE-14665] Security test suite runs no tests after CI test suite checker</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14665</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Please see linked development list thread as well as suite&lt;br/&gt;
